      "message": "Merge main into issue/266-tap-minor-sweep\n\nResolves the stock_sim.rs conflict with #21's blade footprint: a lathe\nplan's radius is LathePlan::feature (main), every other tool sweeps\ntool_law::cutting_radius (a tap its thread's core, #266).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
